以下是优化后的代码，修复了权限控制的漏洞，并改进了代码的可读性和安全性。

### 关键修改点：
1. **权限控制修复**：
   - 原代码中，`getCourse` 方法允许学生访问所有课程内容，而没有检查学生是否注册了该课程。修复后，学生只能访问自己注册的课程。
   - 添加了一个 `enrollments` 数组，用于记录学生与课程的关联关系。

2. **代码结构优化**：
   - 将用户和课程的查找逻辑抽取为单独的方法，避免重复代码。
   - 增加了对无效用户或课程 ID 的检查，防止潜在的错误。

3. **安全性增强**：
   - 增加了对用户角色的明确检查，防止未授权的用户访问课程。

4. **可扩展性改进**：
   - 增加了学生注册课程的功能，便于扩展。

### 优化后的代码：
```php
<?php
class User {
    public $id;
    public $username;
    public $role;

    public function __construct($id, $username, $role) {
        $this->id = $id;
        $this->username = $username;
        $this->role = $role;
    }
}

class Course {
    public $courseId;
    public $title;
    public $content;
    public $teacherId;

    public function __construct($courseId, $title, $content, $teacherId) {
        $this->courseId = $courseId;
        $this->title = $title;
        $this->content = $content;
        $this->teacherId = $teacherId;
    }
}

class EducationPlatform {
    private $users = [];
    private $courses = [];
    private $enrollments = []; // Array to track student-course relationships

    // Add a new user
    public function addUser($id, $username, $role) {
        $user = new User($id, $username, $role);
        $this->users[] = $user;
    }

    // Add a new course
    public function addCourse($courseId, $title, $content, $teacherId) {
        $course = new Course($courseId, $title, $content, $teacherId);
        $this->courses[] = $course;
    }

    // Enroll a student in a course
    public function enrollStudent($studentId, $courseId) {
        $user = $this->findUserById($studentId);
        $course = $this->findCourseById($courseId);

        if ($user && $course && $user->role === 'student') {
            $this->enrollments[] = ['studentId' => $studentId, 'courseId' => $courseId];
            return true;
        }
        return false;
    }

    // Get course details with proper access control
    public function getCourse($userId, $courseId) {
        $user = $this->findUserById($userId);
        $course = $this->findCourseById($courseId);

        if (!$user || !$course) {
            return null; // Invalid user or course
        }

        // Teachers can access their own courses
        if ($user->role === 'teacher' && $course->teacherId === $userId) {
            return $course;
        }

        // Students can access courses they are enrolled in
        if ($user->role === 'student' && $this->isStudentEnrolled($userId, $courseId)) {
            return $course;
        }

        // Access denied
        return null;
    }

    // Check if a student is enrolled in a course
    private function isStudentEnrolled($studentId, $courseId) {
        foreach ($this->enrollments as $enrollment) {
            if ($enrollment['studentId'] === $studentId && $enrollment['courseId'] === $courseId) {
                return true;
            }
        }
        return false;
    }

    // Find a user by ID
    private function findUserById($userId) {
        foreach ($this->users as $user) {
            if ($user->id === $userId) {
                return $user;
            }
        }
        return null;
    }

    // Find a course by ID
    private function findCourseById($courseId) {
        foreach ($this->courses as $course) {
            if ($course->courseId === $courseId) {
                return $course;
            }
        }
        return null;
    }
}
